  "limitations": [
    "Exact canonical rotations and camera inclinations are display adaptations, not sourced manufacturer angles.",
    "Upward bearing is a necessary geometric test; this audit is not a full hand/rope equilibrium simulation. Regenerate native routes and visually review each selected grip.",
    "edge-6-upper and edge-6-lower are legacy names bound to mirrored left/right complete U grooves; both contain both opposing sidewalls and a bottom. Both retained depth witnesses choose native Y=+9 sidewall, runtime +Z. Preserving identities therefore permits both at X=-90, but their highlighted region is broader than the single bearing rail.",
